    "title": "Keep an outcome despite a hypothetical obstacle",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-concession-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Keep an outcome despite a hypothetical obstacle",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Acknowledge a hypothetical obstacle while keeping the main result. This does not claim that the obstacle is necessary for the result. 就是…也… can concede even an extreme hypothetical condition while retaining the outcome.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "即使下雨，我也去学校。",
                "pinyin": "jíshǐ xiàyǔ ， wǒ yě qù xuéxiào 。",
                "meaning": "Even if it rains, I will go to school.",
                "audio": "ad331ade99f14805ffa70e364286ac0e0b1ea6c7f98b3bc6b3c5e528da5d2c0f"
              },
              {
                "text": "就是下雨，我也去学校。",
                "pinyin": "jiùshì xiàyǔ ， wǒ yě qù xuéxiào 。",
                "meaning": "Even if it rains, I will still go to school.",
                "audio": "d2211a9fbcc7094a4c6f0b5744d40c2cbd00a09ddc88fffc4948c47bd3eaf6ac"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
